    <string name="about_text">GP32emu 1.0.0\n\nIn game, press Back or the menu button to pause. On a gamepad, press its Mode button or hold Start and Select together. Use a keyboard (arrows, Z/X = A/B, A/S = L/R, Enter = Start, Shift = Select) or a gamepad with touch controls hidden.\n\nGames are copied into app storage and saves are automatic. Save states have 3 slots per game in the pause menu. Uninstalling the app deletes copies, saves and states.\n\nBased on gameblabla/gp32emu.\ngithub.com/gajae1/gp32emu</string>
